="content" data-v-e77c4050><h3 data-v-e77c4050>International Shipping &amp; Receiving</h3><div class="des" data-v-e77c4050>We ship your purchase to the address you specify.</div></div></div><!--]--><a href="/customize/etsy-product" data-v-e77c4050><button ariadisabled="false" type="button" class="hh-button hh-button--primary hh-button--large is-round" style="" data-v-e77c4050><!--v-if--><span class=""><!--[-->View Hot Product Sources<!--]--></span></button></a><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><div class="platform-hot-sourcing" style="margin-bottom:170px;" data-v-e77c4050><h2 class="title text-center" data-v-e77c4050>Best Items to Dropship</h2><div class="platform-select" data-v-e77c4050><!--[--><div class="active platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>Etsy Hot Sources</div><div class="platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>AliExpress Hot Sources</div><div class="platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>Temu Hot Sources</div><div class="platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>Shopify Hot Sources</div><div class="platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>Amazon Hot Sources</div><!--]--></div><div class="goods-list" data-v-e77c4050><!--[--><!--]--></div><div class="flex justify-center" style="margin-top:64px;" data-v-e77c4050><button ariadisabled="false" type="button" class="hh-button hh-button--primary hh-button--large is-plain is-round" style="padding:12px 65px;" data-v-e77c4050><!--v-if--><span class=""><!--[-->More Hot Products<!--]--></span></button></div></div><div class="recommend-sourcing" style="margin-bottom:170px;" data-v-e77c4050><h2 class="title text-center" data-v-e77c4050>Recommended Products</h2><div class="platform-select" data-v-e77c4050><!--[--><div class="active platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>Gifts for Her</div><div class="platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>Gifts for Him</div><div class="platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>Christmas Gifts</div><div class="platform-select-item" data-v-e77c4050>New Year Gift</div><!--]--></div><div class="goods-list" data-v-e77c4050><!--[--><!--]--></div><div class="flex justify-center" style="margin-top:64px;" data-v-e77c4050><button ariadisabled="false" type="button" class="hh-button hh-button--primary hh-button--large is-plain is-round" style="padding:12px 65px;" data-v-e77c4050><!--v-if--><span class=""><!--[-->More Recommended Products<!--]--></span></button></div></div><div class="why-to-choose" data-v-e77c4050><h2 class="title text-center" data-v-e77c4050>Why to Choose</h2><div class="des-wrap flex flex-wrap" data-v-e77c4050><!--[--><div class="des-item" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/whyChoose/img1.webp" alt="des-icon" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><div class="des-content" data-v-e77c4050><h3 class="des-title" data-v-e77c4050>Good quality and low price goods</h3><div class="des-text" data-v-e77c4050>Support purchasing goods from 1688, Taobao, Tmall, fully enjoy the quantity and price advantage of goods, we do not charge any price difference of goods.</div></div></div><div class="des-item" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/whyChoose/img2.webp" alt="des-icon" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><div class="des-content" data-v-e77c4050><h3 class="des-title" data-v-e77c4050>Quality check</h3><div class="des-text" data-v-e77c4050>When your items arrive at our warehouse, we will check the quality of the items and report to you if we find any defective issues.</div></div></div><div class="des-item" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/whyChoose/img3.webp" alt="des-icon" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><div class="des-content" data-v-e77c4050><h3 class="des-title" data-v-e77c4050>Free Storage</h3><div class="des-text" data-v-e77c4050>You can wait until all orders arrive at our warehouse before shipping them together. All items will be stored with us for 180 days free of charge.</div></div></div><div class="des-item" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/whyChoose/img4.webp" alt="des-icon" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><div class="des-content" data-v-e77c4050><h3 class="des-title" data-v-e77c4050>Flexible Packing</h3><div class="des-text" data-v-e77c4050>You can send orders from different sellers together as one package or split an order into several packages in order to send them to different addresses.</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="partnerBrands-wrap" data-v-e77c4050><h2 class="title text-center" data-v-e77c4050>Partner Brands</h2><div class="brands flex flex-wrap justify-around" data-v-e77c4050><!--[--><img src="/home/brandGrey/img1.webp" alt="brand-logo" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/brandGrey/img2.webp" alt="brand-logo" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/brandGrey/img3.webp" alt="brand-logo" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/brandGrey/img4.webp" alt="brand-logo" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/brandGrey/img5.webp" alt="brand-logo" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/brandGrey/img6.webp" alt="brand-logo" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/brandGrey/img7.webp" alt="brand-logo" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><!--]--></div></div><div class="content-max-1356" data-v-e77c4050><div class="buyer_review" data-v-e77c4050><h2 class="title text-center" data-v-e77c4050>Buyer Reviews</h2><div class="review-wrap flex flex-wrap justify-around" data-v-e77c4050><!--[--><div class="review-item" data-v-e77c4050><img src="/home/avatar/img1.webp" alt="buyer-avatar" loading="lazy" data-v-e77c4050><div class="buyer-name" data-v-e77c4050>Zephyra</div><div class="buyer-country" data-v-e77c4050>USA</div><div class="hh-rate hh-rate--large is-disabled" role="slider" aria-label="rating" aria-valuenow="5" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="5" tabindex="0" style="" data-v-e77c4050><!--[--><span class="hh-rate__item"><i class="hh-icon hh-rate__icon is-active" style=""><!--[--><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024"><path fill="currentColor" d="M283.84 867.84 512 747.776l228.16 119.936a6.4 6.4 0 0 0 9.28-6.72l-43.52-254.08 184.512-179.904a6.4 6.4 0 0 0-3.5